   "text": "Let your face soften. Let your eyes close. Let your shoulders drop. Let your arms rest heavy at your sides. Let your hands open. Feel the mattress holding you, the pillow supporting your head. You do not have to hold yourself up tonight. You are held. Let the warmth of rest spread slowly through your chest, your stomach, your hips, your legs, all the way down to your feet. Every part of you is known by the God who made you. Every cell is in his care. Rest now."
  }
